5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Hello everyone. To ensure we establish a fair and sustainable fee structure, we must first analyze the actual costs and the current membership patterns. I believe a data-driven approach is the only way to avoid errors.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I couldn't agree more, Asuka. A touch of rigor now will save us from a comedy of errors later. I'm quite looking forward to seeing what the numbers actually tell us before we start guessing.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I agree that a calm, thoughtful look at the facts is the best way to begin. Let us see what the records reveal before we decide.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not get too carried away with the ""rigor"" just yet. We need to see where the friction is. I'll be interested to see if the numbers actually match the reality of how people are behaving.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm in. But let's be real—we can't just guess the numbers like we did last time. We need to know exactly what we're working with so we don't screw this up for everyone.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the ""Last year's ledger of outgoings"" and the ""Sign-up records for mid-year joiners."" It is essential to understand our actual expenditures and how new members are integrating into the club.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall look into the ""Outgoing treasurer's logged hours"" and the ""Tally of the sign-in sheets."" I'm curious to see if the administrative burden is as daunting as the rumors suggest, and who is actually attending.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will look into the ""Tally of the sign-in sheets"" and ""The rota against the attendance record."" I wish to understand the balance of participation and who has been supporting our activities most frequently.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll check the ""Weekday turnout since the summer outings"" and the ""Quieter members at the winter social."" I want to see if people are actually showing up or if they're just paying for the privilege of staying home.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'll check the ""Bank statements on last year's renewals"" and ""Last year's ledger of outgoings."" I want to see exactly how much money is actually in the account and where it's all going.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, @Jonathan, since you are both checking the sign-in sheets, I expect a detailed comparison of attendance. It will be interesting to see if the active core matches the financial contributions.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I shall be delighted to provide a detailed report. It would be a tragedy to discover we are funding a ghost club, wouldn't it? I look forward to comparing my findings with Jonathan's.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I would be happy to share my findings. It is often in the quiet details of the records that we find the most truth. I look forward to seeing how our observations align.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Benjamin, @Jonathan, don't get too lost in the ""truth"" of the paperwork. A sign-in sheet only tells you who walked through the door, not why the others are suddenly hesitating to do so.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're always talking about ""why,"" but ""why"" doesn't pay the bills. I'm more worried about the fact that we don't even know if we have enough cash to start the year. Let's get the facts first.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Takumi. While the social dynamics Shunichi mentions are relevant, they cannot be addressed without a stable financial foundation. Let us proceed with the research and reconvene once the data is available.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Let us all venture into the archives. I shall return shortly, hopefully with news that the treasurer's role isn't a full-time vocation in disguise. Until then, happy hunting, everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. Let us each take our time with the records and find the peace of clarity. I look forward to hearing what you all discover. Until then, I wish you all a productive search.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll be back soon. Let's just hope the data is actually useful and not just a collection of numbers that ignore the real mood of the club. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm on it. I'm going to find out exactly where we stand so we can stop guessing and start planning. I'll see you all in the next round with the real numbers.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
